{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33599","headline":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 八 · 许棠","name":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹霄空把桂枝归，白首依前着布衣。\n当路公卿谁见待，故乡亲爱自疑非。\n东风乍喜还沧海，栖旅终愁出翠微。\n应念无媒居选限，二年须更守渔矶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33599.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33599","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}